  "description": "The Vamoose Tri-Cycle SST is the ideal electric cycle for getting around town, making a grocery run, commuting to work, or cruising around the neighbourhood.STABILITY, COMFORT & CONTROLThe Vamoose Tri-Cycle SST is powered by an upgraded 52V 750W rear drive motor, providing power through a rear differential to the rear tires. With three fat tires on the pavement, the Vamoose Tri-Cycle SST is ideal for anyone looking for extra stability, comfort, and control in their ride.\n\nWith a low step (about 15\"), this Vamoose Tri-Cycle SST is also ideal for anyone with hip or mobility challenges and comes standard with a folding handlebar stem to improve stowing. As well, the Vamoose Tri-Cycle SST comes standard with a large capacity rear rack, bag, and and front \"shovel\" rack for additional convenience.\n\nWith a 3-speed internally geared hub, powerful hydraulic disc brakes with parking assist, rear differential (dramatically improving handling, traction and reduces strain on the drivetrain including pedals, crank, chainring, cassette, and derailleur), and 20\"x4\" fat puncture-resistant tires as well as a large 52W 20Ah battery, the Vamoose Tri-Cycle SST is ready to take you where you need to go.This cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• 52V 750W Rear Hub Motor\n\n• 52V 20 Ah Samsung Battery\n\n• NEXUS geared hub shifter\n\n• Rear differential\n\n• Super comfortable plush seat\n\n• Water resistant rear carrier bag\n\nSPECIFICATIONS\n\nMotor Format:\nSingle Rear\n\nFront Motor:\nN/A\n\nMid Motor:\nN/A\n\nRear Motor:\nVAMOOSE 52V 750W\n\nDerailleur and shifters:\nSHIMANO NEXUS 3-SPEED\n\nThrottle:\nYes - twist throttle\n\nDisplay:\nLarge BC351 Colour with USB\n\nBattery:\n52V 20Ah Samsung\n\nCharger:\n3A\n\nFront forks :\nRST Forks with lock-out\n\nRear Suspension:\nn/a\n\nDropper Seat Post:\n\nFrame:\n6061 Aluminum\n\nBrakes:\nHydraulic w parking brake\n\nWheels:\n20\" X 4\" Chaoyang Mountain\n\nPedals:\nWellgo\n\nSaddle:\nComfort\n\nFront 